---
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default section-has-background section-has-parallax"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:50px"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-3-12 grid-8-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h2 class="center">Vyskúšajte si Protel ZADARMO!</h2>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-4-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-image"><div class="flexcard flexcard-icon flexcard-none size-lg align-center"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-icon-wrapper"><div class="image-icon"><img alt="Hedvika Trunečková" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/hedvika-truneckova-protel.webp"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-4-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h2 class="center">Nezáväzne Vám zavolám a dohodneme termín krátkeho predvedenia systému.</h2>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-4-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:30px"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12">
<form action="https://databridge.pianopos.cz/api/web-lead" autocomplete="off" class="block block-form" data-lead-form="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat" id="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat" method="post">
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_input_tel" id="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat-field-wrapper-vas-telefon">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<label for="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat-field-vas-telefon" id="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat-label-vas-telefon">
            Váš telefón <span>*</span>
</label>
<input class="field-control" id="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat-field-vas-telefon" name="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat[vas-telefon]" placeholder="Zadajte svoje telefónne číslo" required="" type="tel" value=""/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_button" id="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat-field-wrapper-zadarmo-vyskusat">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<div class="center">
<button class="btn btn-a btn-default" id="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat-field-zadarmo-vyskusat" name="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat[zadarmo-vyskusat]" type="submit" value="submit"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">ZADARMO VYSKÚŠAŤ</span></button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<input name="form_variant" type="hidden" value="formular-zadarmo-vyskusat"/><input name="page" type="hidden" value=""/><div aria-hidden="true" class="visually-hidden"><label>Web <input autocomplete="off" name="website" tabindex="-1" type="text"/></label></div></form>
</div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-inline"><p class="center">Vaše osobné údaje budú spracované v súlade s <a href="/sk/podmienky-spracovania-osobnych-udajov-formular">Podmienkami spracovania osobných údajov</a>.</p>
</div></div></div>
